1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,579
WasteRecast helps a business turn an unclear
waste description into recovery

2
00:00:04,579 --> 00:00:08,909
leads and an acceptance enquiry. Our
Sustainability and Social Impact prototype

3
00:00:08,909 --> 00:00:13,238
focuses on a practical obstacle: knowing which
facility is worth approaching,

4
00:00:13,238 --> 00:00:15,600
and what evidence is still missing.

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:21,207
Here we enter an illustrative scenario: five
tonnes per month of polypropylene

6
00:00:21,207 --> 00:00:26,164
offcuts in Pune. The records are real public
listings; this producer scenario

7
00:00:26,164 --> 00:00:30,708
is not real. This recording uses our private
local Gemini connection.

8
00:00:30,708 --> 00:00:33,600
The public website uses Firebase AI Logic.

9
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:38,750
Gemini identifies plastic, extracts the stated
quantity and location, and

10
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:41,900
lists missing laboratory results and buyer
quotes.

11
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:45,050
Source and checks exposes the input quotations.

12
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:49,550
The model's confidence is an extraction
estimate, not measured accuracy

13
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:53,600
or proof that a recycler can accept this
material.

14
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:57,563
Find recovery leads screens the sourced catalog.

15
00:00:57,563 --> 00:01:02,769
We show five leads first, ordered by state and
district proximity.

16
00:01:02,769 --> 00:01:07,974
Asking Gemini to review produces a recovery-
route hypothesis and the key

17
00:01:07,974 --> 00:01:12,707
unanswered question. These are potential leads,
not confirmed buyers, live

18
00:01:12,707 --> 00:01:14,600
prices, or road-distance rankings.

19
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:20,234
For A K Enterprises, the source identifies
plastic granules and links to

20
00:01:20,234 --> 00:01:23,141
page eighty-one of the Maharashtra board
directory.

21
00:01:23,141 --> 00:01:27,294
The app asks for current authorization, exact
accepted composition, capacity

22
00:01:27,294 --> 00:01:31,862
and a written price. Published contact details
are shown where available;

23
00:01:31,862 --> 00:01:35,600
missing phone numbers and email addresses are
not invented.

24
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:40,891
Prepare enquiry creates a draft containing the
material, quantity, origin,

25
00:01:40,891 --> 00:01:44,140
source link and questions for the facility.

26
00:01:44,140 --> 00:01:48,782
Nothing is sent automatically. All four review
checks start unconfirmed.

27
00:01:48,782 --> 00:01:56,672
A user can save the lead, copy the draft, or
print it as a PDF after reviewing

28
00:01:56,672 --> 00:01:57,600
the information.

29
00:01:58,250 --> 00:02:01,768
The commercial calculator belongs to the
selected facility.

30
00:02:01,768 --> 00:02:06,166
Without actual buyer and transport quotes, its
value remains pending.

31
00:02:06,166 --> 00:02:11,003
Once supplied, it annualizes the quantity times
avoided disposal cost plus

32
00:02:11,003 --> 00:02:14,082
the buyer quote, minus transport and
pretreatment.

33
00:02:14,082 --> 00:02:17,600
Gemini does not invent revenue or environmental
savings.

34
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:20,789
Recast also supports natural-language app
actions.

35
00:02:20,789 --> 00:02:23,751
We type, prepare enquiry for lead one.

36
00:02:23,751 --> 00:02:27,983
The assistant interprets the request and opens
the actual enquiry.

37
00:02:27,983 --> 00:02:33,061
Live voice uses Gemini and the Aoede voice with
a selectable microphone.

38
00:02:33,061 --> 00:02:35,600
Only validated application tools can run.

39
00:02:36,250 --> 00:02:40,874
The interface includes four language options,
light and dark modes, optional

40
00:02:40,874 --> 00:02:45,498
documents and clear next steps. Worldwide
discovery uses open map records,

41
00:02:45,498 --> 00:02:47,600
with material acceptance explicitly unverified.

42
00:02:48,250 --> 00:02:51,493
Firebase hosts the app. Firestore serves the
catalog.

43
00:02:51,493 --> 00:02:56,357
Gemini powers understanding and Recast. Our next
step is a verified buyer

44
00:02:56,357 --> 00:02:59,600
pilot. Explore WasteRecast and the public source
code.
